title: "The Trade Economy Index"
abstract: >-
  US skilled-trade economics for 13 commercial trades: labor, market structure,
  unit economics, cash cycle, AI exposure, geography, and valuation, with the
  per-cell citations where applicable, research-pass workflow metadata, and
  table-level provenance for derived and aggregate tables.
